            "review_text": "Maybel K\nSingapore, Singapore1 contribution\n0\nGood food and friendly staff\nAug 2018 • Couples\nThe food at this restaurant were tastier with bigger serving and cheaper in price as compared to the famous restaurant a few units away (534 Vinh Khanh). The staff here were also more friendly and can speak a little English. We ordered 6 dishes (twice for the shell) plus 4 bottles of beer yesterday and it costs us about vnd690,000 here. Today we ordered 4 dishes plus 2 bottles of beer at 534 Vinh Khanh and it costs us vnd500,000. We regretted for not coming back to this restaurant after our disappointing experience over at 534 Vinh Khanh.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 10, 2018",
